#. ~ Description of scenario "Smuggler's Hideout" for male
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After a disastrous smuggling run, you thought to fly your ship, The Vanishing"
" Arc, to the most remote and backwater system you could find.  You estimate "
"you have at least six months before the Nyssian cartels catch up with you, "
"and you need to make the most of it."
msgstr ""

