#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/achievements/achievements.json
msgid "Boneyards"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of achievement "Boneyards"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/achievements/achievements.json
msgid ""
"We had those at home too, on summer days we'd chase frogs through the pipes and into the coolant chambers deep below them.  I remember the em-lights still glittering in the immense halls, it was like a secret night sky sealed away.\n"
"<color_c_dark_gray>  - overheard in Port Augustmoon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Boneyards"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/achievements/achievements.json
msgid "Visit a ruin"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/achievements/achievements.json
msgid "Ruins of Orion"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of achievement "Ruins of Orion"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/achievements/achievements.json
msgid ""
"I try not to think about what it actually means, none of us do really.  Otherwise it would drive us mad with grief.  [Laughs] Still drives some mad though, I guess.\n"
"<color_c_dark_gray>  - \"Life in the Tenellus Frontier\", interview with salvor guild journeyman, c2514."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Ruins of Orion"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/achievements/achievements.json
msgid "Visit many ruins."
msgstr ""

