#. ~ Description of achievement "Chimera"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/achievements/achievements.json
msgid ""
"Unexplained, instinctual urges might rarely manifest after bio-modification.  In such cases we recommend the following self-centering techniques…\n"
"<color_c_dark_gray>  - Aftercare brochure, Mercurial Genomics ltd."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Chimera"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/achievements/achievements.json
msgid "Cross a threshold using genetech templates."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/achievements/achievements.json
msgid "The New Sun"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of achievement "The New Sun"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/achievements/achievements.json
msgid ""
"There were among our men those who asked whether it was all not a dream.  How else could one explain the glimpse of things never heard of, never seen, and never even conceived of before.\n"
"<color_c_dark_gray>  - recovered from the log of ESS Firebird."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "The New Sun"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/achievements/achievements.json
msgid "Gain psionic powers."
msgstr ""

