#. ~ Description of "ancient spaceship deed"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/lore_items.json
msgid ""
"An ancient document from before the Discontinuity, detailing the purchase of the Vanishing Arc by your great-great-grandfather, signed and validated by a long nonexistent Earth polity.\n"
"\n"
"A simple legal curiosity of no real value, true ownership of this ship is guaranteed by the self-destruct mechanism you have programmed into its main reactor."
msgstr ""

