#. ~ Description of "ancient medal"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/lore_items.json
msgid ""
"An ancient medal given for exemplary service in Van Maneen's Exploratory "
"Navy.  You have no idea what the Van Maanen Navy was, or how this thing ended"
" up in the display case, but getting rid of it would make you uncomfortable."
msgstr ""

